[node name="ExpectationLabel" type="Label" parent="Ui/VBox" unique_id=779428375]
layout_mode = 2
text = "Expected:
- A 10x6 region gets yellow Cover tiles on every cell inside it, framed by
  a ring of 8 distinct hues just OUTSIDE the region - one per Back/Front x
  Top/Bottom/Left/Right edge category (a top-edge tile sits one row above
  the region, not on its top row)
- Two red marker tiles (just above the top edge + region center) never
  change - they are hand-placed Overrider tiles the generator must skip
- Clicking Generate Decorations re-rolls the light/dark shade mix on every
  non-red cell (weighted pick, from each Gen_ layer's own TileSet) without
  moving or removing the red markers

All art is placeholder flat color: the framework ships no tile art."

